{"symbol":"OTS.WA","area":"poland","updated":"2026-11-09T19:55:17Z","info":{"address1":"Zbozowa Street 4","city":"Szczecin","zip":"70-653","country":"Poland","phone":"48 60 913 0265","website":"https://www.otlogistics.pl","industry":"Integrated Freight & Logistics","industryKey":"integrated-freight-logistics","industryDisp":"Integrated Freight & Logistics","sector":"Industrials","sectorKey":"industrials","sectorDisp":"Industrials","longBusinessSummary":"OT Logistics S.A. engages in port transshipments and freight forwarding services in Poland, and Central and Eastern Europe. The company operates through Port activities; Freight services; Railway activity; and Hydrotechnical and other activities segments. It offers transshipment, warehousing, storage, packaging, and forwarding of port services; comprehensive door-to-door logistics services, and organizes rail, road, and sea transport through various seaports; provision of comprehensive rail transport services, such as siding, shunting and transport by Kolej Baltycka SA; as well as inland waterway transport, transport services support the implementation of hydrotechnical projects, leasing and rental services of vessels, and real estate rental and other ancillary activities. The company was formerly known as Odratrans S.A. and changed its name to OT Logistics S.A. in 2012. OT Logistics S.A. was founded in 1946 and is headquartered in Szczecin, Poland.","fullTimeEmployees":590,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Pavel  Marouek","title":"CEO & Chairman of Management Board","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Jakub  Kudyn","title":"Member of the Management Board","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Martin  Vozar","title":"Member of Management Board","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0}],"executiveTeam":[],"maxAge":86400,"priceHint":2,"previousClose":15.18,"open":14.96,"dayLow":14.96,"dayHigh":15.26,"regularMarketPreviousClose":15.18,"regularMarketOpen":14.96,"r